Modifications: the Codex app-server and broker runtime were replaced with
one-shot `opencode run --standalone --format json` executions; reviews now
collect the diff and request schema-shaped JSON through prompts; read-only
runs inject a dedicated OpenCode agent per run; Codex-specific features
(session transfer, GPT prompting skill, model aliases) were removed; command,
skill, agent, and test names were changed from Codex to OpenCode. Changed
JavaScript files carry a "Modified from openai/codex-plugin-cc" header; the
command, agent, skill, and prompt Markdown files were also adapted.

